WEBVTT

01:37.880 --> 01:41.000
Two streets away
is your sister's courtyard.

01:42.880 --> 01:43.760
I know.

01:47.640 --> 01:48.880
All these years,

01:49.400 --> 01:51.920
your junior sister has acted
as a messenger.

01:53.280 --> 01:56.920
Every now and then,
I could tell how she was doing.

02:05.880 --> 02:08.120
Don't sniff the tree, or it'll go bald.

02:16.520 --> 02:17.360
Bai Wan!

02:21.200 --> 02:22.320
This is the second this year.

02:23.160 --> 02:25.120
I need you to make another sudden trip.

02:25.800 --> 02:29.240
So you've kept writing to him
all these years

02:29.960 --> 02:32.480
just because you want to know
every year that he's safe?

02:34.360 --> 02:35.640
Yes…

02:37.120 --> 02:38.400
and no.

02:39.600 --> 02:43.240
Seeing how he's all by himself,
he does seem a bit pitiful.

02:44.240 --> 02:46.360
I have been writing for so many years

02:46.440 --> 02:49.840
because I want him to know
someone out there is thinking of him.

02:50.560 --> 02:53.600
Now you're on your own too,
living all alone in Chang'an,

02:53.680 --> 02:55.240
and I care about you as well.

02:56.760 --> 02:59.720
You have to let me know
that you are safe every single day.

03:01.600 --> 03:02.920
I'm not made of porcelain.

03:03.000 --> 03:04.760
I'm not that easy to crack or bruise.

03:05.960 --> 03:07.400
Better safe than sorry.

03:09.840 --> 03:10.840
How about this?

03:10.920 --> 03:13.400
If you ever run into danger,

03:13.480 --> 03:16.800
you can let a paper kite fly.

03:17.560 --> 03:19.760
I have plenty of eyes and ears
in the city.

03:19.840 --> 03:21.000
They will tell me right away.

03:41.280 --> 03:42.680
I almost got him.

03:42.760 --> 03:44.760
I chased him to Yanzuo Ward,

03:45.520 --> 03:47.880
but Qingyi showed up and pulled him out.

03:50.080 --> 03:51.280
He slipped into Hidden Soldier Alley.

03:53.680 --> 03:55.760
When the Huben Army was first established,

03:55.840 --> 03:58.000
my father secretly
set up Hidden Soldier Alley.

03:58.080 --> 04:01.160
There are hidden bases in Chang'an.

04:01.240 --> 04:04.440
Inside them are enough food and weaponry.

04:05.040 --> 04:06.080
If they ever need to retreat,

04:06.160 --> 04:09.760
there are craftsmen assigned
to make travel passes for the Huben Army.

04:10.360 --> 04:11.880
Where is it? I can go in.

04:11.960 --> 04:13.440
No need to rush.

04:13.520 --> 04:16.079
He is inside. He won't come out just yet.

04:17.160 --> 04:18.279
My goal is to wipe out

04:18.360 --> 04:20.600
the entire Huben Army
centered around Yan Fengshan.

04:21.440 --> 04:24.600
There is no intel confirming that
Yan Fengshan is in Hidden Soldier Alley,

04:24.680 --> 04:26.280
so sending troops is pointless.

04:26.360 --> 04:28.440
It would only alert them.

04:41.680 --> 04:42.520
Stop.

04:46.360 --> 04:49.920
You may not know me,
but you should at least know him.

04:50.000 --> 04:51.280
OLD WOMAN
GATEKEEPER OF HIDDEN SOLDIER ALLEY

04:51.360 --> 04:52.400
I know you two.

04:53.440 --> 04:56.400
But the general set the rules.

04:57.080 --> 04:59.560
Anyone entering or leaving
Hidden Soldier Alley

04:59.640 --> 05:02.520
has to leave gold behind.

05:07.440 --> 05:08.280
Hurry up.

05:14.720 --> 05:16.200
Wait.

05:17.000 --> 05:20.160
I bought you some pinellia and poria.

05:20.240 --> 05:23.680
Boil them and drink the decoction
every day. It helps your throat.

05:52.000 --> 05:52.880
Go.

05:56.120 --> 05:57.360
Ziyan, this way.

06:09.440 --> 06:10.400
Ziyan.

06:20.120 --> 06:22.640
Who on earth injured you so badly?

06:24.000 --> 06:25.720
A man who was already supposed to be dead.

06:28.200 --> 06:32.200
Pu Nichuan.

06:34.960 --> 06:36.400
But last night,

06:37.520 --> 06:39.280
he was dead for good.

06:42.720 --> 06:45.840
Whoever is behind all this
is really something.

06:47.880 --> 06:50.800
Even a discarded pawn
of the Huben Army was put to use.

06:52.200 --> 06:56.040
The one behind this
is someone you probably know too.

07:04.240 --> 07:07.440
My brother's son, Liu Zhi.

07:08.040 --> 07:08.880
He's all grown up.

07:17.280 --> 07:22.640
He probably came back
to avenge his father.

07:33.000 --> 07:33.960
Ziyan.

07:34.040 --> 07:37.040
I don't come here very often.

07:37.120 --> 07:40.280
Stay here and take your medicine.
Rest and recover.

07:40.360 --> 07:42.440
Once I bring a physician back,

07:43.280 --> 07:45.200
you can stay here and focus on recovering.

07:45.280 --> 07:48.800
Once your wounds mend,
you can go wherever you want.

07:48.880 --> 07:50.720
Leave on your own whenever you like.

07:50.800 --> 07:55.520
You only need to show up
when General Fengshan summons you again.

07:59.120 --> 08:00.960
Since when did you

08:02.720 --> 08:04.360
start arranging my affairs?

08:04.440 --> 08:06.400
You're overthinking it, Ziyan.

08:07.640 --> 08:11.680
What I'm saying is,
just focus on getting better.

08:12.920 --> 08:14.600
As for the rest, leave it to me.

08:18.040 --> 08:21.960
That brat ran off
with the deposed emperor.

08:22.560 --> 08:25.520
General Fengshan sent word.

08:26.320 --> 08:29.080
He must live.

08:29.160 --> 08:30.760
If he dies,

08:31.880 --> 08:34.039
the deposed emperor's whereabouts
will vanish.

08:35.440 --> 08:37.880
It'll ruin General Fengshan's grand plan.

08:39.320 --> 08:40.880
It won't be that easy.

08:42.840 --> 08:47.160
The people around him
aren't simpletons either.

09:02.400 --> 09:03.800
TRAVEL PASS

09:21.480 --> 09:23.600
Someone close to him

09:25.720 --> 09:27.400
is already in my control.

09:33.520 --> 09:37.680
The Liu bloodline
isn't so easy to deal with.

09:38.760 --> 09:39.960
Ziyan,

09:41.960 --> 09:43.400
when it comes to killing,

09:44.880 --> 09:46.560
I'm nothing compared to you.

09:49.280 --> 09:51.600
But when it comes to scheming,

09:54.560 --> 09:56.120
you may not match me.

09:56.960 --> 09:58.560
You're back.

09:58.640 --> 09:59.560
-I'm back.
-Here.

09:59.640 --> 10:00.560
Alright.

10:02.440 --> 10:05.840
IRON

10:09.240 --> 10:10.600
The General's letter.

10:10.680 --> 10:13.720
Choose the most alert person
to deliver it.

10:13.800 --> 10:14.880
Yes.

10:17.560 --> 10:19.440
-Be quick.
-Understood.

11:52.000 --> 11:54.240
This is what happens when you oppose me.

11:57.440 --> 11:59.040
From now on,

11:59.760 --> 12:02.880
I am willing to be a slave or a mutt.

12:22.880 --> 12:25.400
Back at the Grand Academy,

12:25.480 --> 12:28.240
every time the teacher scolded you,
you would copy the Shanglin Ode

12:29.000 --> 12:31.200
so your heart could feel a little lighter.

12:32.840 --> 12:34.400
After all these years,

12:36.280 --> 12:38.280
you haven't made any progress.

12:48.000 --> 12:49.960
You shouldn't have used
your own handwriting.

12:50.560 --> 12:52.320
If someone sharp notices it,

12:53.360 --> 12:54.760
we'll be targeted.

12:55.560 --> 12:57.640
And Mo is my pageboy.

12:58.280 --> 13:01.680
A pageboy doesn't need
to write things like this.

13:02.200 --> 13:03.360
Then…

13:05.960 --> 13:07.160
what should I write?

13:10.640 --> 13:12.520
You should write a letter home.

13:12.600 --> 13:14.600
Say the business
in the Capital is improving,

13:14.680 --> 13:16.520
and you'll return after some time.

13:16.600 --> 13:18.760
As for him and his family,

13:20.360 --> 13:21.760
I'll tell you what to say.

13:31.920 --> 13:33.760
Mo is my pageboy.

13:35.200 --> 13:37.520
He grew up with me.

13:38.560 --> 13:40.400
We studied in the clan school together.

13:43.920 --> 13:44.960
His handwriting

13:46.680 --> 13:48.400
carries the brushstroke style
of my family.

13:50.840 --> 13:52.520
Remember this well.

13:53.800 --> 13:55.440
From now on,

13:56.640 --> 13:58.320
whenever you write a turning stroke,

14:00.760 --> 14:02.920
slow your brush at the finish.

14:09.960 --> 14:12.000
His wife is called Yanniang.

14:13.960 --> 14:15.600
She's a fisherwoman.

14:16.520 --> 14:18.000
Kind-hearted.

14:18.680 --> 14:20.800
A wonderful cook.

14:22.080 --> 14:24.240
Yanniang gave him two children.

14:24.920 --> 14:28.480
A boy who's 6, named Xiaoman.

14:29.360 --> 14:33.080
A girl who's 4, named Chudong.

14:33.800 --> 14:35.240
You two, slow down.

14:35.320 --> 14:37.200
Mo is gentle by nature.

14:38.040 --> 14:39.480
He knows what I'm thinking.

14:42.160 --> 14:43.640
He said he wanted to do his part.

14:46.800 --> 14:47.880
And I agreed.

14:50.080 --> 14:51.560
But it's all my fault.

14:54.520 --> 14:55.720
Right now,

14:58.000 --> 15:00.280
he should be on his way home.

15:02.800 --> 15:04.920
He would've reached home
by the end of the month.

15:08.520 --> 15:11.720
His family lives by a small hill
outside Huzhou.

15:13.520 --> 15:15.160
Three little rooms.

15:16.680 --> 15:18.360
A modest patch of farmland.

15:18.440 --> 15:20.520
-Dinner's ready!
-Coming!

15:22.200 --> 15:24.000
It's enough to provide
for the whole family.

15:26.320 --> 15:29.360
He could've lived out his life
safe and sound.

15:32.840 --> 15:36.200
Mother, we get to eat eggs today!

15:42.160 --> 15:44.480
But you ruined everything.

15:51.560 --> 15:52.600
Mo…

15:54.600 --> 15:55.680
Where is he buried?

15:56.720 --> 15:58.680
You don't deserve to know.

16:33.120 --> 16:34.960
If you sit here any longer without a word,

16:35.040 --> 16:37.280
the neighbor lady
is going to come out with a stick.

16:40.160 --> 16:42.000
Alright. I'm coming down.

17:14.800 --> 17:16.359
So pretty.

17:17.040 --> 17:18.760
What fabric is this?

17:18.839 --> 17:21.680
Don't touch it.
I'm rushing to finish this.

17:21.760 --> 17:25.280
If you get it dirty, they'll dock my pay.

17:26.560 --> 17:29.920
Alright. I won't touch it.
I won't touch it.

17:30.000 --> 17:31.400
ZHAOLU

17:51.520 --> 17:54.360
Is staring at me
supposed to cook the rice?

17:55.680 --> 17:56.520
It is.

17:57.480 --> 17:58.400
I'll cook it.

18:05.200 --> 18:06.440
Come and eat.

18:07.160 --> 18:08.040
Here.

18:13.160 --> 18:15.880
-It really is cooked.
-Liu Ziyan is back.

18:22.960 --> 18:24.200
Don't worry.

18:25.200 --> 18:27.240
He calls himself
the Huben Army's top assassin.

18:27.320 --> 18:29.240
But he's nothing special in my eyes.

18:29.320 --> 18:30.800
I crossed blades with him last night.

18:30.880 --> 18:31.720
I struck him three times.

18:31.800 --> 18:33.560
Chest, back, left shoulder.

18:33.640 --> 18:35.280
I almost took his head off.

18:36.240 --> 18:39.880
Too bad… the brat still escaped.

18:40.800 --> 18:41.640
And you?

18:43.640 --> 18:44.680
Not a scratch on me.

18:48.840 --> 18:49.920
Why is your clothing torn?

19:01.000 --> 19:02.560
When did my clothes get torn?

19:02.640 --> 19:03.680
-Let me see your wound.
-No.

19:04.920 --> 19:06.320
Men and women should…

19:09.200 --> 19:10.760
Let's eat first.

19:17.600 --> 19:19.800
Consider the silver I paid you earlier

19:21.880 --> 19:24.080
a payment for
those three strikes last night.

19:24.160 --> 19:25.000
Alright?

19:26.240 --> 19:27.280
From now on,

19:28.400 --> 19:32.120
you don't have to risk your life anymore
to avenge me against Liu Ziyan.

19:32.200 --> 19:33.560
Why not?

19:36.280 --> 19:38.560
I earn only 100 wen for a wedding quilt,

19:38.640 --> 19:40.920
and 50 wen for a wedding outfit.

19:41.560 --> 19:44.440
Even if I sew for ten more years,

19:44.520 --> 19:46.320
I still wouldn't be able
to afford your service.

19:46.920 --> 19:48.200
I don't want money.

19:55.000 --> 19:56.200
I don't want money.

20:04.520 --> 20:05.560
Stay away!

20:25.960 --> 20:27.480
Why do you keep following me?

20:33.240 --> 20:34.560
Are you good at killing people?

20:36.840 --> 20:38.440
As you saw. Yes.

20:45.880 --> 20:48.640
I began sewing to survive when I was 14.

20:49.680 --> 20:51.880
This is all I've saved
these past five years.

20:57.880 --> 20:59.160
This is the man's portrait.

20:59.240 --> 21:00.800
I want you to kill him.

21:00.880 --> 21:01.880
Why do you want him dead?

21:01.960 --> 21:03.880
My mother was a seamstress.

21:05.280 --> 21:07.000
Every time she finished a garment,

21:07.520 --> 21:09.400
she'd deliver it
to the client's residence.

21:09.480 --> 21:10.520
That winter solstice,

21:11.120 --> 21:14.080
she braved the snow
and brought a newly finished cloak

21:14.160 --> 21:16.240
to Liu Ziyan's residence.

21:19.120 --> 21:23.760
But Liu Ziyan accused her of being a spy
who eavesdropped for secrets.

21:25.120 --> 21:27.760
Liu Ziyan hung my mother
right at our doorstep.

21:30.560 --> 21:32.760
When she died,
even her kneecaps were carved out.

21:39.000 --> 21:42.080
This is the deposit.
I'll make up the rest someday.

21:45.280 --> 21:46.600
I don't kill for money.

21:52.560 --> 21:54.000
A deposit, though…

22:06.760 --> 22:07.600
Give me a smile first.

22:25.400 --> 22:27.080
What you just said…

22:28.360 --> 22:29.600
were you feeling sorry for me?

22:33.200 --> 22:34.440
I was worried about you.

22:36.600 --> 22:38.320
What's there to worry about?

22:38.400 --> 22:40.720
I made you a promise, so I'll get it done.

22:43.360 --> 22:47.160
Also, from now on,
don't bring up the money again.

22:48.400 --> 22:49.840
You've already paid.

23:11.200 --> 23:12.520
Fresh vegetables!

23:12.600 --> 23:14.440
Come take a look!

23:14.520 --> 23:16.200
Crisp and tender greens!

23:17.600 --> 23:18.800
Come look!

23:20.520 --> 23:22.760
-Come take a look.
-Fresh greens today.

23:22.840 --> 23:24.480
I picked them this morning.

23:24.560 --> 23:26.640
-Come look.
-I'll take one.

23:26.720 --> 23:28.320
Take care, miss.

23:31.960 --> 23:33.160
Very nice.

23:33.240 --> 23:35.680
-These are handwoven by us.
-This one.

23:35.760 --> 23:36.600
-This looks good.
-It suits you.

23:36.680 --> 23:37.520
-Alright.
-The silver one is nice.

23:37.600 --> 23:38.640
I'll take that one then.

23:39.440 --> 23:40.640
Miss, want to look at kites?

23:40.720 --> 23:42.960
-How much is this?
-Two wen.

23:46.040 --> 23:47.120
-Here.
-Thank you.

24:34.680 --> 24:35.840
Pick some more.

24:35.920 --> 24:37.080
They're very fresh.

24:48.800 --> 24:53.160
If you ever run into danger,
you can let a paper kite fly.

24:53.240 --> 24:55.720
I have plenty of eyes and ears
in the city.

24:55.800 --> 24:57.000
They will tell me right away.

25:00.240 --> 25:01.320
Thank you.

25:01.400 --> 25:03.680
Sesame oil.

25:03.760 --> 25:05.480
It flies really high.

25:06.840 --> 25:07.840
Come take a look.

25:11.640 --> 25:12.920
-Sesame oil.
-This one.

25:13.720 --> 25:15.080
-I'll take one.
-Alright.

25:15.160 --> 25:16.280
Pears!

25:17.000 --> 25:18.880
Xiaoqing, why aren't you…

25:18.960 --> 25:20.720
I'm never buying pears from you again.

25:23.080 --> 25:26.240
This girl… What's gotten into her today?

25:27.560 --> 25:28.840
Thank you, miss.

25:28.920 --> 25:30.880
Take care. Come again next time.

25:31.680 --> 25:34.440
Rain capes! Selling rain capes!

25:35.040 --> 25:36.320
Rain capes!

25:36.840 --> 25:37.680
-Go over there.
-Yes.

25:37.760 --> 25:38.800
Go.

26:30.240 --> 26:31.760
You're sharp.

26:33.360 --> 26:35.880
You could tell
those men outside were mine.

26:36.760 --> 26:38.480
Has no one ever told you

26:39.600 --> 26:42.640
you don't need to act
so high and mighty all the time?

26:45.560 --> 26:48.520
You know, I grew up without parents.

26:49.480 --> 26:51.600
I was raised being beaten
in an opera troupe.

26:52.280 --> 26:56.440
My masters told me
when you live in this world,

26:56.520 --> 26:59.400
every movement onstage,

26:59.480 --> 27:02.120
every frown and smile
is something people have to watch.

27:02.640 --> 27:04.880
If anyone found it displeasing,

27:05.480 --> 27:07.280
my masters would beat me.

27:08.120 --> 27:11.360
So I've had to watch myself
every moment of every day.

27:11.440 --> 27:14.000
Regardless of whom I'm performing for.

27:23.800 --> 27:25.960
The kite flew away.

27:28.920 --> 27:30.360
Which means you're not leaving.

27:32.400 --> 27:34.240
The night Mr. Yu died,

27:35.280 --> 27:37.160
you didn't even give me two hours.

27:38.000 --> 27:39.760
Why would you give me two days?

27:50.720 --> 27:52.480
You're worthless.

27:52.560 --> 27:55.400
But the person you were writing to
has value of his own.

28:09.880 --> 28:11.720
I was only bait.

28:54.120 --> 28:55.640
I saw that. What are your hands doing?

29:02.680 --> 29:05.160
Split this bundle,
then split the next two days' worth.

29:05.760 --> 29:07.120
I'll check before dark.

29:32.440 --> 29:34.440
Assassin! There's an assassin!

29:36.760 --> 29:37.680
Where?

29:41.320 --> 29:43.360
The assassin you're talking about is her?

29:44.200 --> 29:46.480
What are you yelling for?
Get back to work.

29:49.760 --> 29:51.680
Why are you here? What's the rush?

29:51.760 --> 29:52.720
What happened?

29:53.600 --> 29:55.840
It's Bai Wan. Something happened to her.

30:29.760 --> 30:30.720
The Huben Army.

30:30.800 --> 30:32.000
Xiaoqing was followed on her way back.

30:32.600 --> 30:33.840
They surrounded the courtyard.

30:34.760 --> 30:35.840
Wait.

30:35.920 --> 30:37.600
Is there a secret tunnel or a hidden room?

30:37.680 --> 30:38.560
No.

30:39.520 --> 30:40.480
They brought many men.

30:41.400 --> 30:43.360
The only ones here who can fight
are Xiaoqing and me.

30:45.880 --> 30:48.520
I caused this mess. I'll deal with it.

30:54.440 --> 30:56.880
Fire. Burn the walls first.

31:19.680 --> 31:22.560
I can't get out.
And no one is coming to save me.

31:23.680 --> 31:26.160
To you, I'm useless.

31:26.240 --> 31:27.840
Stop wasting time.

31:27.920 --> 31:29.960
How is it a waste?

31:30.920 --> 31:32.920
Maybe you don't know this yet.

31:33.520 --> 31:36.600
The person you were writing to
is already back in Chang'an.

31:38.200 --> 31:40.360
And what you definitely don't know

31:40.440 --> 31:43.560
is that your little messenger
was still being watched,

31:43.640 --> 31:47.960
even if you two had your little tricks.

31:50.920 --> 31:55.120
All it takes is one trip
to where he lives.

31:55.200 --> 31:57.120
Once she does that,

31:58.080 --> 31:59.240
his location

32:00.840 --> 32:02.680
is exposed.

32:58.880 --> 33:00.600
-Don't let a single one escape!
-Yes.

34:22.600 --> 34:25.480
I'm going to save her.
Break through, then go find Mr. Long.

34:26.159 --> 34:27.000
Stay alive.

35:23.360 --> 35:27.280
Wherever you go, write to me.

35:28.120 --> 35:31.640
Let me know you're safe every year.

35:31.720 --> 35:33.720
YOUNG BAI WAN

35:33.800 --> 35:36.880
I only want to know
that he's safe every year.

35:37.760 --> 35:40.080
So all these years,
I've kept writing to him.

35:40.680 --> 35:44.000
Seeing him all alone,
he seemed a little pitiful.

35:45.120 --> 35:46.880
All these years of writing,

35:47.400 --> 35:51.200
I only wanted him to know
that someone is thinking of him.

36:04.000 --> 36:05.200
Still alive, I see.

37:19.480 --> 37:20.560
Go!

37:23.360 --> 37:24.520
Go.
